claim.claim-text:
- providing a joining element (24), which comprises a first joining surface (26), and providing of a component (28), which comprises a second joining surface (30);
- providing a joining device (12) adapted to join the joining element to the component through arc welding;
- preparing the first and/or second joining surface (26; 30); and
- carrying out a joining process with the joining device, in which the joining element (24) is joined to the component (28);
wherein the preparing step comprises a plasma gas cleaning method
wherein the plasma cleaning method consists of applying plasma to the component by means of a cleaning device separate and independent from the technology used to carry out the joining process.
